# Gordon (29095), level 60, is hit for 10 by the character's level 20 servitor: a servitor holds no
# inventory, so Gordon's attacked hook asks it for Zariche or Akamanah and ends there, and
# RaidBossStandard, which would want to attack a playable attacker by its hit, never answers it:
# Gordon wants nothing of the servitor. The character's own hit after it runs the whole chain.
character Hunter 20
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.RaidBoss.RaidBossStandard
script script.ai.individual.Monster.RaidBoss.RaidBossAlone.RaidBossType1.Gordon
script script.ai.individual.Monster.RaidBoss.RaidBossAlone.RaidBossType1.RaidBossType1
npc gordon 29095 RaidBoss 100 0 0 level 60
summon pet 14001 servitor 20

hit gordon 10 by pet
  desires gordon move_route()=10
hit gordon 10
  desires gordon attack(player)=2985.0746268656712 move_route()=10
